# ─── Terraform ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Provider binaries and module cache (re-downloaded by `terraform init`)
**/.terraform/*
# State files contain resource IDs and can contain secrets — they live
# ONLY in the remote Azure Storage backend, never in git.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Local overrides and variable files that may hold personal values.
# Committed env settings use the explicit name `terraform.tfvars` (no secrets).
*.auto.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed — it pins provider checksums.

# ─── Secrets / local config ───────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
kubeconfig*
.kube/

# ─── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/

# ─── Scan / build output ──────────────────────────────────────
results_*.sarif
*.sarif
checkov-report*
dist/
build/

# ─── OS / editor ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp

# ─── Hand-off folder for files remote tools may not write directly ───
_incoming/

# ─── Chat downloads saved by the Claude desktop app ───
Claude outputs/

# ─── Kubernetes values generated at deploy time from `terraform output` ───
k8s/overlays/*/generated/
